# FAMILY MEMBERS
# The member making requests comes from {{familyMemberId}} in your environment.
# Update and Delete below act on the member created by "Create", never on yours.
# See README.md for environments and labels.

### READ ONLY — List family members
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/family
Accept: application/json
X-Hearth-Secret: {{hearthSecret}}

### READ ONLY — The current member (from your environment)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/family/me
Accept: application/json
X-Hearth-Secret: {{hearthSecret}}
X-Family-Member-Id: {{familyMemberId}}

### CHANGES DATA — Create a family member
# @name createFamilyMember
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/family
Content-Type: application/json
X-Hearth-Secret: {{hearthSecret}}

{
  "name": "test member"
}

### CHANGES DATA — Rename the member created above
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/family/{{createFamilyMember.response.body.$.data.id}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Hearth-Secret: {{hearthSecret}}

{
  "name": "test member (renamed)"
}

### DESTRUCTIVE — Delete the member created above
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/family/{{createFamilyMember.response.body.$.data.id}}
Accept: application/json
X-Hearth-Secret: {{hearthSecret}}
